fast-rdp-server (0.7.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Proxy module: lab-only switch fastrdp_proxy_tls_keylog (proxy.ini
    TlsKeyLogFile, default off) writes the TLS secrets of every client
    connection to /var/cache/fastrdp-proxy/tls-keylog.txt (mode 0600, a
    warning per connection, never the back-end hop), so Wireshark can
    decrypt a capture of the mstsc reconnect runs; switching it off
    removes the file (backlog A5).
  * Broker, desktop picker: GNOME is marked "(log out of the other desktop
    first)" ([ui] picker_blocked) while the user has another graphical
    session, and a desktop that can start is preselected (backlog A6).
  * Webgate notifications: ntfy_ca_file (Ansible
    fastrdp_web_notify_ntfy_ca_src) trusts the CA of a private ntfy
    server, also for Web Push to webpush_extra_hosts; preflight.yml checks
    the notification setup (ntfy health and token, CA file, VAPID key);
    fastrdp-setup asks for the backends, ntfy URL, token and CA (backlog
